# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# SEVA MARKET INDIA — environment variables
# Copy this file to `.env` and adjust values.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Database connection (@libsql/client).
# Dev foundation uses a local SQLite-compatible file (relative to project root):
DATABASE_URL="file:./dev.db"

# Production options (same Drizzle schema — see docs/ARCHITECTURE.md):
# 1. libsql/Turso (zero-change): DATABASE_URL="libsql://your-db.turso.io"
#    (+ libsql auth token passed via the Turso platform's env, if used)
# 2. PostgreSQL: port db/schema.ts to drizzle-orm/pg-core,
#    DATABASE_URL="postgresql://user:password@host:5432/seva_market"
